invariant: INV-4
file: srv_kex.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh srv_kex
reason: srv_kex_begin draws the server's x25519 scalar into h->pub,
  where x25519_base then writes the public value, so the scalar stays
  zero. The srv_kex proof asserts that the draw writes h->priv, and
  fails on this edit.

--- old
    rand_draw(&h->t->cfg, h->priv, sizeof h->priv);
--- new
    rand_draw(&h->t->cfg, h->pub, sizeof h->pub);
